{"4459350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HADALYTH ZERO", "steam_appid": 4459350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/dc231fc37b2bd9a183f14fa1a8402f2f.poster.avif?t=1787867124\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/dc231fc37b2bd9a183f14fa1a8402f2f.webm?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/dc231fc37b2bd9a183f14fa1a8402f2f.mp4?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There are over 300 unique fish to catch in HADALYTH ZERO.  Catch them all to gain a deep sense of personal accomplishment and show off to your friends that you're the one true penguin fishing master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/baa486d76c779659eff5bd083bbca6bc.poster.avif?t=1787867124\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/baa486d76c779659eff5bd083bbca6bc.webm?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/baa486d76c779659eff5bd083bbca6bc.mp4?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With hundreds of unique cosmetics ranging from a normal Gentoo Penguin all the way to the exotic and coveted Dragon Penguin, there is something for everyone.  Truly express your inner penguin in ways you've never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/bb51154962e577297e2ae4876c96c8fc.poster.avif?t=1787867124\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/bb51154962e577297e2ae4876c96c8fc.webm?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/bb51154962e577297e2ae4876c96c8fc.mp4?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>HADALYTH ZERO has every way to communicate with other players.  You can use text chat, voice chat, and even picture chat to write, talk, and draw whatever you're trying to say.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/dc231fc37b2bd9a183f14fa1a8402f2f.poster.avif?t=1787867124\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/dc231fc37b2bd9a183f14fa1a8402f2f.webm?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/dc231fc37b2bd9a183f14fa1a8402f2f.mp4?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There are over 300 unique fish to catch in HADALYTH ZERO.  Catch them all to gain a deep sense of personal accomplishment and show off to your friends that you're the one true penguin fishing master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/baa486d76c779659eff5bd083bbca6bc.poster.avif?t=1787867124\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/baa486d76c779659eff5bd083bbca6bc.webm?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/baa486d76c779659eff5bd083bbca6bc.mp4?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With hundreds of unique cosmetics ranging from a normal Gentoo Penguin all the way to the exotic and coveted Dragon Penguin, there is something for everyone.  Truly express your inner penguin in ways you've never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/bb51154962e577297e2ae4876c96c8fc.poster.avif?t=1787867124\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/bb51154962e577297e2ae4876c96c8fc.webm?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/extras/bb51154962e577297e2ae4876c96c8fc.mp4?t=1787867124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>HADALYTH ZERO has every way to communicate with other players.  You can use text chat, voice chat, and even picture chat to write, talk, and draw whatever you're trying to say.</p>", "short_description": "HADALYTH ZERO is a penguin-based multiplayer fishing chatroom game with fleshed out life-sim mechanics. Catch hundreds of unique fish, customize your penguin, complete objectives, and hangout with people.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/5491f4ab29c9893313c13eb2c2af6cc86e5eb409/header.jpg?t=1787867124", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459350/6fff2